# .semgrepignore — overrides semgrep built-in defaults.
#
# Semgrep's built-in defaults exclude "tests/" which prevents the
# factoryboy-bare-factory-call rule from scanning the test suite.
# Providing this file replaces those defaults so we control what is
# excluded explicitly.
#
# Reference: https://semgrep.dev/docs/ignoring-files-folders-code/

.venv/
.tox/
node_modules/
.git/
*.min.js
*.min.css
migrations/
